%%{init: {'sequence': {'wrap': true, 'width': 230, 'actorMargin': 40}, 'theme': 'dark', 'themeVariables': {'lineColor': '#000000', 'actorLineColor': '#000000', 'signalColor': '#000000', 'signalTextColor': '#000000'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant PD as ProjectDetailPage (React)
    participant VL as VulnerabilityList (React)
    participant PS as Project Service :8082
    participant SS as Scan Service :8083
    participant DB as scan_db (MySQL)

    User->>PD: Open a project
    Note over PD: fetchProjectData sends three requests in parallel (Promise.all), each with the Bearer JWT

    par project details
        PD->>PS: GET /api/projects/{id}
        PS->>PS: JwtAuthenticationFilter, requireOwnedProject (ownership rule)
        PS->>SS: GET /api/scans/projects/{id}/vulnerabilities (forward JWT)
        SS->>DB: findLatestByProjectId(id, ownerId): latest COMPLETED scan per repository
        DB-->>SS: rows
        SS-->>PS: List of VulnerabilityDTO
        PS-->>PD: ProjectResponseDTO (vulnerabilityCount, criticalCount)
    and repositories
        PD->>PS: GET /api/projects/{id}/repositories
        PS-->>PD: repository list
    and vulnerabilities
        PD->>SS: GET /api/scans/projects/{id}/vulnerabilities
        SS->>DB: findLatestByProjectId(id, ownerId)
        DB-->>SS: vulnerabilities with ai_suggestions
        SS-->>PD: List of VulnerabilityDTO (with AiSuggestionDTO)
    end

    PD-->>User: Render tabs, repositories and vulnerability list
    PD->>VL: pass vulnerabilities
    VL-->>User: Severity badges, confidence percentage, AI suggestion text

    opt User changes a vulnerability status
        User->>VL: choose new status
        VL->>SS: PATCH /api/scans/vulnerabilities/{id}/status?status=
        SS->>DB: UPDATE vulnerabilities SET status (owner check first)
    end

    alt token expired or invalid on any call
        SS-->>PD: 401 - response interceptor clears session and redirects to /login
    end
